{"name":"A Mirage of a Hammer Wielding Friend","size":"medium","type":"humanoid","tag":"","alignment":"???","hitDice":"65","armorName":"other","shieldBonus":0,"natArmorBonus":3,"otherArmorDesc":"16","speed":"30","burrowSpeed":"0","climbSpeed":"0","flySpeed":"0","hover":false,"swimSpeed":"0","customHP":true,"customSpeed":false,"hpText":"65","speedDesc":"30 ft.","strPoints":"18","dexPoints":"10","conPoints":"18","intPoints":"8","wisPoints":"8","chaPoints":"12","blindsight":"0","blind":false,"darkvision":"0","tremorsense":"0","truesight":"0","telepathy":0,"cr":"1","customCr":"1 (200 XP)","customProf":2,"isLegendary":false,"legendariesDescription":"The monster can take 3 legendary actions, choosing from the options below. Only one legendary action option can be used at a time and only at the end of another creature's turn. The monster regains spent legendary actions at the start of its turn.","isLair":false,"lairDescription":"When fighting inside its lair, the monster can invoke the ambient magic to take lair actions. On initiative count 20 (losing initiative ties), the monster can take one lair action to cause one of the following effects:","lairDescriptionEnd":"The monster can't repeat an effect until they have all been used, and it can't use the same effect two rounds in a row.","isMythic":false,"mythicDescription":"If the monster's mythic trait is active, it can use the options below as legendary actions for 1 hour after using {Some Ability}.","isRegional":false,"regionalDescription":"The region containing the monster's lair is warped by the creature's presence, which creates one or more of the following effects:","regionalDescriptionEnd":"If the monster dies, the first two effects fade over the course of 3d10 days.","properties":[],"abilities":[{"name":"Mirage of Family","desc":"This unit is a mirage of one of the members of the Bleeding Lotus of Treefell. This unit has the same resistances and physical attributes as __Meridia, the Miasmic Blade, but they will act autonomous to him. However, they will move and attack in any way that benefits **Meridia, the Miasmic Blade.**"},{"name":"Lifebearing Miasma","desc":"At the end of every full turn, the Miasma tends to this unit's wounds, healing them for 1d12 HP."},{"name":"Unsheathing","desc":"Under 50% Max HP, this unit unsheathes and forms a smaller hammer, allowing them to utilize **Multiattack** and attack twice per turn."}],"actions":[{"name":"Hammer Slam","desc":"This unit brings their hammer up and over themselves, slamming it into a victim. \n(+9) to hit, 5ft, single target. On a hit, the user deals [3d8] bludgeoning damage."}],"bonusActions":[],"reactions":[{"name":"Protective Stance","desc":"As a reaction, this unit may take the hit for one ally within 10 feet of them, redirecting focus for the attack and taking half damage."}],"legendaries":[],"mythics":[],"lairs":[],"regionals":[],"sthrows":[],"skills":[],"damagetypes":[{"name":"fire","note":" (Vulnerable)","type":"v"}],"specialdamage":[],"conditions":[],"languages":[{"name":"Deep Speech","speaks":true}],"understandsBut":"","shortName":"","pluralName":"","doubleColumns":true,"separationPoint":1,"damage":[]}